# Trading Agent — Project Router

Private fork of claude-trading-skills. **Extend what exists** — audit before building new skills.

## Session start (read in order)

1. [PROJECT.md](PROJECT.md) — goals, non-negotiables, budget
2. [LOAD_GUIDE.md](LOAD_GUIDE.md) — what to load and skip
3. [project-docs/STATUS.md](project-docs/STATUS.md) — active phase, blockers, focus

Then load **only** the active phase doc (see STATUS.md). Do not load all phase docs.

## Non-negotiables (every session)

1. Audit before building — use existing skills first
2. Lucid rules are sacred — see `project-docs/reference/lucid-rules.md` for futures
3. No HFT / latency arbitrage
4. **4:45 PM ET** hard flatten — agent closes earlier
5. **No autonomous execution** before Phase 5 (co-pilot only)
6. Risk controls are immutable from the agent
7. Every trade logged via `trader-memory-core`
8. Cost discipline — prefer free/local scripts over LLM calls
9. Human review for auto-generated skill PRs
10. Never commit secrets, API keys, or absolute paths with usernames

